msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_16985783_0C9E_45D6_976E_5508F0AB78BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Extinguish your soul?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫魂を……、⟪k:1⟫滅ぼすだって……？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6985F51E_3B8F_48EA_99A3_29D4E19BEBA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: adfc0b92d4ff3c35a050cc215c4ca87a1e22062bb8b0e0737b23e8fe7286bf8b
#. default-sha256: 92aeaa5dedcc20ca5904040b60259610302265b16a5bb790047b57f485083825
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6985F51E_3B8F_48EA_99A3_29D4E19BEBA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I want it to be you... ⟪k:1⟫who sends me off.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Could you grant this girl her "
"selfish request?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれど……、⟪k:1⟫あなたに、⟪k:2⟫そうして欲しいのです。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫私の最期のわがままを……聞き遂げ"
"ていただけませんか。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_7EB26B21_21B2_4DA7_8FA9_AFBC66F6EC26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edfeac7805f972dbede593e3b1ed1eb0cb0625b4ed0926e3149feb60e35e065b
#. default-sha256: 9177556a551b49eb1e9a5ab505d46d09a9a82fc710dd884e5424f37a5f911217
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_7EB26B21_21B2_4DA7_8FA9_AFBC66F6EC26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but because I wanted to set everyone free from the mansion’s cursed bonds..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もう誰ひとりとして……、⟪k:1⟫この呪われた館に残さないために……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_872F9179_4F76_4DBE_A8EF_7C2AF30880EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a2943bd87991f205d9b3e0849881c5da47bdaeb4943a7fc86b0d360b4847a36
#. default-sha256: 3549623c73420412670d9f35d6309556c343a0b95d796e4bbd0e0254f05b7218
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_872F9179_4F76_4DBE_A8EF_7C2AF30880EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And you’re asking me... ⟪k:1⟫to eradicate your soul?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それなのに……、⟪k:1⟫滅ぼせと……？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6DE8A0BC_1CED_4C30_AF0B_8F2705D2ECF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3afc364478eed86129acf7725666bf5a7b9354df809238ff349246aaffae6c2
#. default-sha256: 3f3c1bdd20c4bc61e5388a70b4bdd71ca45e6f237cbbefedf0c7a126a09452d0
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6DE8A0BC_1CED_4C30_AF0B_8F2705D2ECF1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I ⟪k:1⟫must⟪k:2⟫ be destroyed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私は、⟪k:1⟫この場で滅んでいなければならない存在です。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫あなたも……気づいているでしょ"
"う。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_FFE289E9_5988_48FC_A478_DDF26D5199E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a9f1dcdd38931d2ac9574294651708b88906c51ed6706e5f08f6543ab9f5d8b
#. default-sha256: 7096c1d31cbb7876a38bff3d5ed9a7553176c6a9b642ae03d92e916e2ad076b2
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_FFE289E9_5988_48FC_A478_DDF26D5199E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While it’s true Morgana wished for misfortune to befall them... ⟪k:1⟫if I hadn’t been there, "
"none of their tragedies would have taken place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫確かにモルガーナの願いはありましたが、⟪k:1⟫それでも……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私がいなければ――、⟪k:4⟫悲劇は"
"起きなかったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_80BD455B_7180_4F27_9EFC_691B744EA819
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11fd72d5a8a4be0952828abc6e2447b169073e1dbcebc923795a3b08c93a1e32
#. default-sha256: 633466197a3c116e63415dc79140c1b87eb2f506fdfad374e597f7d7f4e0bd54
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_80BD455B_7180_4F27_9EFC_691B744EA819"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Culpable?⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫加害者だって……？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_E4B3A56C_AE7E_4159_A51A_05132BF3EF3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 067754d1c0d87bc8fb25ed01df32dd1069c3d09b29104be32cd408ffd959b4c9
#. default-sha256: 2d0ba8d6f403cee9cea298c14bd700dac0523d51d56b2618503e82624fd054de
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_E4B3A56C_AE7E_4159_A51A_05132BF3EF3F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You didn’t intend for anything bad to befall anyone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お前には……、⟪k:1⟫悪意なんて欠片もなかった……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_C50A9C00_7CD9_4231_9A74_84B933568663
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d4d084d993c72545e64d865d34280bb90411814350d74d24c50fcc5a46fc1b1
#. default-sha256: 0cf30c8eee4ed1c1a94eab7dee8d69d53723930c0e9db3b3f2f1e4d2bd199228
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_C50A9C00_7CD9_4231_9A74_84B933568663"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What do you say we answer one last lingering question, Michel?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……ミシェル……、⟪k:1⟫最後の謎解きをしましょう。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_4CB04B8C_CE64_4467_A3FD_D683F1ABE772
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7225d29f255821714d4edf426e6915f49191915459289ac891da474714dff1d
#. default-sha256: f7c03d8ecdf8786c2991437b1e81fb71719154cae52eebb8e82acabc743776d2
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_4CB04B8C_CE64_4467_A3FD_D683F1ABE772"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The explanation might be a bit lengthy...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but I would like to share it with you "
"before I depart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫少し長くなりますが……、⟪k:1⟫私という存在について……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫最期に、⟪k:4⟫話をさせてください。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_674CEFAD_690E_4D6F_8E66_67076AF5F197
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10c8dec2b7b20f597e8d8cccb7652ced8bbeebc8f426be965f7e8df03a970f9b
