msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_674CEFAD_690E_4D6F_8E66_67076AF5F197"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_E6E37D27_E7E9_4AD8_B0AA_20F76E48BEC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ad28b2e7a6bc202f21618734cd839c3f2112d3609ca74bc2329e3718ca9e069
#. default-sha256: 538c5dc179ee78158d6df62747d0c84e01cf202e37883015d972749866b6c522
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_E6E37D27_E7E9_4AD8_B0AA_20F76E48BEC2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Upon her death, Morgana’s soul was afflicted with great pain resulting from the hatred and "
"resentment she bore."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫モルガーナが死を迎えた瞬間、⟪k:1⟫彼女の魂は激しい苦しみに見舞われていました。⟪k:2⟫それは、"
"⟪k:3⟫憎しみと、⟪k:4⟫恨みによるものですが――"

#: scenario9:scenario9_61E105AB_CBC5_45F8_BB12_D4BBD464AF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc5de930fcce165d3d1b31d3bde8ce2b4fb6d34d67091c30c62afaf9ecec24fe
#. default-sha256: 65f5441d7b499d79daf4ced238beae1bff7f04307a45f4ef9cc0792f4db1c0da
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_61E105AB_CBC5_45F8_BB12_D4BBD464AF7B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A saint must put herself second to all others.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She must be caring, generous, "
"forgiving.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And she must not bear any ill will for anyone."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫聖女は……犠牲的でなければなりません。⟪k:1⟫人を思いやり、⟪k:2⟫施しを与え、⟪k:3⟫人を許し、⟪k:4⟫"
"恨むことなどあってはならないのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_22806235_A709_4C41_AC81_AD9B75A68C5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acf659da2fb2187bda7934ab56d7a08d495a7ce47c5d8053e9d78e6239303075
#. default-sha256: cd5389a7df6fb6b60605f0fa23ae34a736f737b16ebced6723df0c105a5903fe
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_22806235_A709_4C41_AC81_AD9B75A68C5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So that’s why you always seemed so... ⟪k:1⟫abnormally pure-hearted..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……そういう……、⟪k:1⟫ことだったのか……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_77EC0F48_FACF_421C_A270_9B439BA11A86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6184e72fb78019f8d30a5979310983ad54f8499986bbdaf8f7a1b0f2dc52bb44
#. default-sha256: a8984b66477d63f094c56f8297c1f3fb685af7a7e7a2a100e11506f252d5f568
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_77EC0F48_FACF_421C_A270_9B439BA11A86"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫お前の性質が……、⟪k:1⟫ずっと……、⟪k:2⟫純粋であり過ぎたのは……。"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お前の性質が……、⟪k:1⟫ずっと……、⟪k:2⟫純粋であり過ぎたのは……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_C7844E63_00A8_4A5C_9E40_77B244818EEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 181bdbb0f2e5fdb2abc2166fe707bfa9f9ba62756787b19f13f3f4a7b10ba540
#. default-sha256: e9bc9b38eca0d5a3ed3187865b4d4f197e3d76ae533fc78844f309fb181cc231
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_C7844E63_00A8_4A5C_9E40_77B244818EEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I refuse to accept..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫生きることを……、⟪k:1⟫願うことが……、⟪k:2⟫いけなかったのだと……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_DB5FE44D_E8BF_4FE4_ADC3_359A9861FAAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f56aa03f9ee3b5b7740b7c3b178501f651c2f467e5f1cff34f524c3477d5c07
#. default-sha256: 90db3c29d1663b3360477da72f6940bfe03d8ded52273b687838fd441b762eee
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_DB5FE44D_E8BF_4FE4_ADC3_359A9861FAAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was never meant to be a soul of my own."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫モルガーナの傍らに居続け――彼女の一部であり続けなければいけませんでした。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_ED3E19B4_F27A_4DBB_9407_E7BDA4CD3900
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98d000b507f5f143eb6e861bca90a05a71deeb8685fb4f9aca158dea9b4f9f5b
#. default-sha256: 331ef64c7abc548cdac939608a26401d5a7ed50baf18963d3d45739e14020fb6
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_ED3E19B4_F27A_4DBB_9407_E7BDA4CD3900"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wished to live,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私の願いは、⟪k:1⟫存在すること。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_9A5A72F1_0937_45A3_9907_771883651318
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c870503bafd347b3abfbf78773af10d469985b51cd7b1648103629273000ab5
#. default-sha256: 2fd5b1bc77dccea26f9d8a86c748f47e25c044485c361daa8166924c225def5d
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_9A5A72F1_0937_45A3_9907_771883651318"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but your own wish?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お前の願いだったのか……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_01EDA556_A383_47E5_9362_9F8E1A0E37F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9c1cf6194aa53cab2eed786b52794c8400197060120d2b93ed30f783d241b39
#. default-sha256: 0e718d3e06a11275380de561485a0f5ab5a89bd37e1becb514bf247a9b4b3d12
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_01EDA556_A383_47E5_9362_9F8E1A0E37F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Which meant that my wish... ⟪k:1⟫had the consequence of granting Morgana’s with it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だから、⟪k:1⟫私の願いが……、⟪k:2⟫モルガーナの願いも叶えてしまったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_EA770485_F763_4E16_90CA_B38FFE952A0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57b8dfbc63b33c410766908b60d9e5eecd5e6b1c13b7933ee81d2a326fa3c1ee
#. default-sha256: 144ad027b67150a79704ba1656dcbb4880d852e4082617c922b89440dfe04e4c
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_EA770485_F763_4E16_90CA_B38FFE952A0A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The house, having attained perpetuity, served as a place for those reconstructed by "
"Morgana’s curse to return to."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫館が永劫に存在し続けてしまったがために、⟪k:1⟫再生の呪いを受けた彼らは、⟪k:2⟫再びあの場に戻る"
"こととなった……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_BF2BAD37_233B_4AAF_BBA1_1D0845550B0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
